  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A monochromatic light is incident from air on a refracting surface of a prism of angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and refractive index <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math> The other refracting surface of a prism is coated by a thin film of material of refractive index <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> as shown in figure. The light suffers total internal reflection at the coated prism surface for an incidence angle of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is_______.<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/0fa3545c-7e73-4435-b603-d061a1b05f24-image27.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/589515s.png\"/><br/>For T.I.R at coating<br/><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sinc</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math> …(i) <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br/>Appling Snell's law at first surface<br/><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br/>for limiting conduction, at <math><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br/><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br/><math><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mo>⇒</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>⇒</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>⇒</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>⇒</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.50</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>",
    "image": null
